	measure 'Revenue dynamic' = ```
			
			VAR ParameterValue = 
			SELECTCOLUMNS(
			    SUMMARIZE('Z. Figure Selector','Z. Figure Selector'[Figure selection],'Z. Figure Selector'[Figure selection Fields])
			    ,'Z. Figure Selector'[Figure selection]
			)
			VAR revenue_value = 
			SWITCH(
			    TRUE()
			    ,ParameterValue = "Last Year", [Revenue LY]
			    ,ParameterValue = "Budget", [Revenue Budget]
			    ,ParameterValue = "Forecast", [Revenue Forecast]
			)
			RETURN revenue_value
			```
		formatString: #,0
		lineageTag: 170e47e1-9b6a-4843-b284-00f9f9d1fd39

		annotation PBI_FormatHint = {"isDecimal":true}

